## Corpus File Pattern

Files named `treasury_bulletin_YYYY_MM.txt`. Before 1983: monthly (01–12). After 1983: quarterly (03, 06, 09, 12). Fiscal year ends June 30 (pre-1976) or September 30 (post-1976).

## Traps

- Preliminary data gets revised 3–6 months later. Check later bulletins if your number looks wrong.
- Multi-header tables are deceptive. Trace the FULL column path: "Parent → Sub → Column."
- "Average" = arithmetic mean. "Average YoY growth rate" = sum of annual % changes ÷ years. Not CAGR.

